SUMMARY:PSP: Intro to Pedagogical Research
DTSTAMP:20260805T111656Z
DTSTART:20260930T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:This session will introduce participants to the benefits of con
	ducting research on classroom teaching. Topics include applying research d
	esign to pedagogical questions and CTE services and resources to support r
